&lt;h2 data-section-id="1dfch1y" data-start="233" data-end="249"&gt;About the job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start="251" data-end="320"&gt;Shape how advanced AI hardware is tested before it reaches customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="322" data-end="556"&gt;You'll lead the technical direction of manufacturing test solutions for Host Processor Modules, Server Blades, and multi-node rack systems. Your work will help ensure every system meets the highest quality standards before deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="558" data-end="817"&gt;You'll own the architecture of the test executive software and develop manufacturing test content that validates complex hardware at scale. Working across hardware, firmware, and software teams, you'll enable reliable, efficient testing throughout production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="819" data-end="1020"&gt;This role offers broad technical influence. You'll solve complex engineering challenges, improve manufacturing quality through data, and help shape the future of Graphcore's production test capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id="1pc0zxi" data-start="1022" data-end="1045"&gt;The team and culture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1047" data-end="1239"&gt;You'll join the Product Test and Diagnosis team within Manufacturing Operations. The team defines and delivers test strategies across silicon, boards, server systems, and rack-scale platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1241" data-end="1439"&gt;Day to day, you'll work closely with engineers across hardware, firmware, software, manufacturing, and quality. Decisions are driven by technical evidence, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="1441" data-end="1589"&gt;You'll have the freedom to lead technically, mentor other engineers, and influence how manufacturing test evolves across globally distributed teams.&lt;/p&gt;
